    "Applies to connected mice only — trackpads keep their acceleration. Pointer speed stays as set in System Settings. Sapphire restores each mouse's previous setting when the feature is turned off or Sapphire quits, and on the next launch if it ever closes unexpectedly.": {
      "comment": "Private full build: Sapphire/App Settings/MouseSettingsView.swift:149",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
