            "value": "Applies to connected mice only — trackpads keep their acceleration. Pointer speed stays as set in System Settings. Sapphire restores each mouse's previous setting when the feature is turned off or Sapphire quits, and on the next launch if it ever closes unexpectedly."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "僅適用於已連接的滑鼠，觸控式軌跡板會保留其加速度。指標速度維持「系統設定」中的設定。關閉此功能或結束 Sapphire 時，Sapphire 會回復每個滑鼠先前的設定；若曾意外關閉，則會在下次啟動時回復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
