    "Camera / Sidecar frames stream to Sapphire windows — using the phone as a *system* camera in Zoom/FaceTime, or Sidecar's true extend mode, needs a system extension / private display API (see docs/continuity/PHASE4-5.md). Universal Control and precise mirror multi-touch use the Android accessibility service; low-latency injection needs Shizuku. Instant Hotspot appears in Sapphire's menu, not the system Wi-Fi menu.": {
      "comment": "Private full build: Sapphire/Services/Continuity/UI/ContinuitySettingsView.swift:922",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Camera / Sidecar frames stream to Sapphire windows — using the phone as a *system* camera in Zoom/FaceTime, or Sidecar's true extend mode, needs a system extension / private display API (see docs/continuity/PHASE4-5.md). Universal Control and precise mirror multi-touch use the Android accessibility service; low-latency injection needs Shizuku. Instant Hotspot appears in Sapphire's menu, not the system Wi-Fi menu."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相機／Sidecar 畫面會串流到 Sapphire 視窗 — 若要在 Zoom／FaceTime 中將手機作為*系統*相機使用，或使用 Sidecar 真正的延伸模式，需要系統延伸功能／私有顯示器 API（請參閱 docs/continuity/PHASE4-5.md）。通用控制和精確的鏡像多點觸控使用 Android 輔助使用服務；低延遲注入需要 Shizuku。即時熱點會顯示在 Sapphire 的選單中，而非系統 Wi-Fi 選單。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
