            "value": "How it works: type : followed by a letter (like :smile) in any text field. Sapphire then shows matching emoji — press Enter or Tab to insert, or type the closing colon for an exact match. A bare : or :123 stays ordinary text."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "運作方式：在任何文字欄位中輸入「:」再加上字母（例如 :smile），Sapphire 就會顯示相符的表情符號。按下 Enter 或 Tab 即可插入，或輸入結尾冒號以完全比對。單獨的「:」或「:123」會保持為一般文字。"
          }
        }
      }
