    "Set up your Dock the way you like it (drag in the apps and folders you use for a task), then capture it as a preset — or start from a Blank Preset and build a custom Dock right here. Create one for coding, another for design — and switch with one click or a hotkey.": {
      "comment": "Private full build: Sapphire/App Settings/DockLayoutsSettingsView.swift:262",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set up your Dock the way you like it (drag in the apps and folders you use for a task), then capture it as a preset — or start from a Blank Preset and build a custom Dock right here. Create one for coding, another for design — and switch with one click or a hotkey."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "依你的喜好設定 Dock（拖入執行某項工作時使用的 App 和檔案夾），然後擷取為預設組合；或從「空白預設組合」開始，直接在這裡打造自訂 Dock。你可以為寫程式建立一組、為設計再建立一組，按一下或使用快速鍵即可切換。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
